Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add .gitignore for node_modules/dist/env files

The repo had no .gitignore at all, so a local npm install/build would
show node_modules and dist as untracked instead of being ignored.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Pn3XFRShNYHEENnPN2cmcC
